了兩位用餐人士，果然英雄所見略同w\n\n奢侈的選擇了客製化拉麵，刻意地選擇了麵軟、不要蔥的選項，沒想到附上的除了筍乾，還有一整顆的溏心蛋耶！\n\n生平吃拉麵很少吃到附上一整個溏心蛋的，幾乎都嘛附上半顆，或是要額外做加點，沒想到小高拉麵居然這麼實惠，才145元，無限量加麵，用餐還有無限量的綠豆湯可以喝之外，居然還很大方的給了三片炙燒過的叉燒肉，跟一整顆的溏心蛋～～～\n\n必須五星好評，另外沒有看到之前留言的蒼蠅問題，看來這家小高拉麵是很用心在整理環境的，重點是吃到一半休息一下的時候，他們的服務生還主動跑來問我：「有需要加麵嗎？」，真的是超級佛系又認真的店家！\n\n而且可能因為還沒到中午用餐時間，現在這個時段（11:40前）來的話，店裏面沒幾個人就算了，冷氣還超級涼的，一點都不悶熱。\n\n附圖為綠豆湯、拉麵本人，與店裡附的冰水，美中不足的地方大概是綠豆湯是溫的、不是冰的，想來應該是早上開店時就煮好的。",null,[0,99]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhUkZOR1NrMVpNRXBEVkcxNFRtRkZUbTlpVm1SWlQwaFdabHBHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2839,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRFNGSk1ZMEpDVG14TmFFTm9iVmRZT0hWZlpGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x14b478e704fc00c8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjZDSFJMY0JCTmxNaENobVdYOHVfZFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRFNGSk1ZMEpDVG14TmFFTm9iVmRZT0hWZlpGRRAB\u0026t\u0