,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這次到土城的小高拉麵用餐，整體體驗算是穩定且具有連鎖體系特色。店內環境維持得相當整潔，座位與吧檯區都整理得乾乾淨淨，給人第一印象不錯。點了標準醬油豚骨拉麵與一碗客製版本(加蔥、加麵、一倍濃)，店家提供麵條硬度、湯頭濃淡、配料等調整選項，對於想依個人口味微調的人來說相當方便。\n拉麵上桌後，湯頭呈現濃郁乳白色，但風味上比較偏向均衡路線，喝起來順口、不會過於厚重，要厚重的也可以加倍。感覺像是經過標準化調整的風味，穩定度高。桌上提供蒜泥與辣油，加入後能讓味道產生明顯變化，蒜香提升層次，辣油則增加些微刺激感，讓整碗麵在食用過程中不會單調。\n麵條中規中矩，與湯頭搭配度尚可，配料部分也維持一定水準。從整體供餐節奏與風味一致性來看，可以感受到背後有系統化備料的優勢，出餐速度與品質都有一定保障。\n如果以價格與可加麵優勢來看，CP值算是不錯，適合想快速吃碗拉麵、又不想踩雷的時候。不過在風味深度上，感覺少了一點長時間熬煮豚骨所帶來的厚實感與層次變化。整體來說，是一間表現穩定、容易入口，適合日常用餐的拉麵店。",null,[0,137]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3195967003082240654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPZEZOdVFqWlVTRlpRVjJ0YVMxRldielZqTW5SdFZqSm9kMVl5WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1218,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOdFNuQjZUSFZQV2taS1FWbzVjMnRtVjJod1YyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x14b478e704fc00c8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNtSnB6THVPWkZKQVo5c2tmV2hwV2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9